<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua Nnongoi ya Pauli kwa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Timoteo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua Nnongoi ya Pauli kwa Timoteo</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Balua yi'no ibu'ka kasangu' nenga na Pauli, nanikemilwe panga nantumilwe wa Kilisitu Yesu kwa amuli ya Nnu'ngu' Nkosopoli witu na Kilisitu Yesu ywatumwu'bi'lya. <verse eid="1TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>Nikuandikya wenga wa Timoteo, wa mwana wangu' wa kakape kwo pitya muimani yitu. Ngu'ngu', kiya na amani bu'ka kwa Tati' bitu Nnu'ngu' na Kilisitu Yesu Bwana witu, ibe pamope na wenga.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Makwi'li'ko bu'kana na mayi'gano ga ubu'su'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Kati mwanaakulu'bite kaniyenda kunkoa wa Makedonia, panga uyendeli igala kukilambo sa Efeso, li'nga wakanikiye bandu yi'gana makowe ga ubu'su'. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Waabakiye panga kanebali'ndi'ndi yaulyana u'mo ya kwai'mbu', no tengenesa nnu'ndu'ngo wa maina ga kiu'ku'lu'. Makowe go galeta mataukano na gatuyangatiyali mulyengo lyatupeyilwe na Nnu'ngu' lyo kosopolya, lyalipalikwa lipangike kwa ndi'la ya imani. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Kitumbu sa kukulagya upange likowe lyo yaai li'nga aumini bapendane kwa mwoyo mpeleteu no binia ganannoga, na imani ya kakape. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Lakini balimu bi'ngi' bagalei go no galambuka longela mayi'gi'yo gabule. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Bapala babe balimu ba salya, lakini bene bagatangiteli makowe gabagayi'gana na kugakong'ondelya.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Tutangite panga salya inogite mana kaitumika kati mwaibinilwe. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Kai', tupalikwa tanga panga salya ibi'kilweli kwa bandu bene aki, ila kwa babati'kwana salya, kingayu'wa, bandu bangali kumwisimu Nnu'ngu', bene sambi, babaakile myoyo na kwa balu' bababulaga abelei babe na abulagi boti. <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>Salya ibi'kilwe kwa kitumbu sa apege, analu'me babayingilyana bene na bene, kwa babaayu'bi'lya bandu na kwapi'mi'ya bapange abanda, abu'su', na babalapa kwa ubu'su'. Salya ibi'kilwe kwa makowe goti gagakana yi'ki'tyana na mayi'gano ga kweli. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Mayi'gano go ga kweli gapatikana mu Abali Inannoga ya utukupu wa Nnu'ngu' mwene balaka. Abali yo nga yanipeyilwe na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sukulu bu'kana na kiya sa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Ninsukulu Bwana witu Kilisitu Yesu ywanipei makakala go panga lyengo lyake, kwa mwanjaa aanibweni nendau'bi'li'ka, ngaanibi'ka mulyengo lyake. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Pamope no panga apo pansu'gu' naatikunkupulu Kilisitu na kwatesa bandu bake kwo panga umbu'ku'su', ila ywembe aanibi'ki kiya kwa mwanjaa naapangite go kwo kotoka tanga no kotoka u'bi'lya kwangu'. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Lakini Bwana witu aanipei ngu'ngu' yake yambone, pamope na imani na upendo mu Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Likowe li' lya kakape na lipalikwa liyi'ki'ti'lwe muno, panga Kilisitu Yesu aaisi mudunia li'nga kwakosopolya bene sambi. Mukipi'nga so, nenga nipi'ti'li'kiye. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Lakini kwa kitumbu so, Nnu'ngu' aanibi'ki kiya. Aapangite nyalu' li'nga kwa ndi'la yangu' nenga nanipi'ti'li'kiye sambi, Kilisitu Yesu apate laya komeya kwake kwa balu' babaalu'a u'bi'lya no pata ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Nnu'ngu' nga Nkulungwa ywangayomoka na awaali, abonekanali na ntu'pu' ywi'ngi' kati ywembe. Nnu'ngu' apoki isima na utukupu milele na milele, Amina.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pauli ankong'ondelya Timoteo li'nga aikamuliye imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Wamwana wangu' wa Timoteo, nikukamukiya lilagyo li'no bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo ga ulondoli wa Nnu'ngu' gagaalongelikwe kwa kitumbu sako. Mayi'gi'yo go gakuyangatiye ku'mbwana ngondo inannoga ya lyengo lya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Uyendeli kumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu' no panga gaugabona manogau. Bandu bi'ngi' baagakani go, ata kwaikiya pa kwileka imani yabe. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Bi'ngi' ba bandu bo nga ki Himenayo na Alekisanda. Bandu bo ninneki Ibilisi li'nga bayi'ganilwe na basomwe kunkupulu Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gano bu'kana na sala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Bai, pangali panga likowe lyolyoti, nilongolya kukulagya panga walu'bi bandu boti kwa kila sampuli ya sala, li'nga Nnu'ngu' apate kwayalya na kwapeya gabapala, bu'kapo unsukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Upalikwa kwalu'bya akulungwa na boti babatawala li'nga tutame muamani no tu'lya mumaisa ga kunnyu'wa Nnu'ngu' na nnyendo unannoga. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Likowe li' linogite na Nnu'ngu' ywatukosopolile endanapusika nalyo, <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>ywapala bandu boti bakosopolelwe na kuutanga ukakape. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Kwa mwanjaa kubile na Nnu'ngu' yumo bai na mwawanikiyi yumo pakati ya Nnu'ngu' na bandu, nembe nga mundu Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>Ywembe aaupiyite bwu'mi wake panga mali'po ga kwakombwa bandu boti. Awu' nga ukong'ondeli waatupei Nnu'ngu' kwa nsimu waaubi'i wiso. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Nanenga kwa kitumbu so nibi'kilwe panga namwaali, ntumilwe na mwalimu wa bandu bangali Ayahudi muimani na ukweli. Ganilongela ga kakape, niku'pi'yali.<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Bai, nipala analu'me bababile kila pandu balu'be Nnu'ngu' kabatu'ndu'bi'ya maboko mapeleteu pangali usika wala mataukano. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Nyinyonyo, alwawa bawale kati mwaipalikwa. Ipalikwa bainemeke kwo li'ngi'lya na kwa isima, kwenda kwa sampuli mbali'mbali' ya manemeko go tiba ndibe, wala kwa zaabu, wala kwa nyambo au ngu'bo ya bei ngu'lu'. <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Ila, kwinemeka kwabe kube kwa iyendo yabe inannoga yaipalikwa na alwawa babayi'ki'ti kunkilikitya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Alwawa bapalikwa batame liki no yu'wa pabayi'ganilwa. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Kai', ninnyi'ki'ti'yali nnwawa yi'gana wala kuntawala nnalu'me, ila atame liki. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Kwa mwanjaa Adamu ngaywatumbwi umbilwa, bu'kapo Awa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Na ywakongilwe no ti'kwana amuli ya Nnu'ngu' aai Adamu lili, ila nnwawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Lakini ata ikatei alwawa baalu'a papa bana, baakosopolelwa mana bayendeli tamiliya muimani, upendo, upeleteu na kwitawala.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Ayi'mi'li'ki mu Likanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Liyi'gi'yo li' lya kakape, panga mundu mana kapala lyengo lya uyi'mi'li'ki wa likanisa, aminyikiya lyengo linannoga. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Bai, nnyi'mi'li'ki wa likanisa apalikwa abe mundu ywangali sitakilwa kwa likowe lyolyoti, apalikwali tola matala, mundu ywo li'ngi'lya na mwene kwitawala, abe ywaisimika, nnogamwoyo, na ywamanyi yi'gana. <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>Kaneabe mundu ywo lobya wi'mbi', kaneapende bulwe, ila abe ywo liya, ywapenda amani na kaneabe ywapenda muno mbanje. <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>Abe mundu ywawesa kwayi'mi'li'ka wiso bana ba panyumba yake, li'nga bawese kunnyu'wa na kwaisimu bandu boti. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Kwa mwanjaa, manaitei mundu kagayagaya kwiyi'mi'li'ka nyumba yake mwene, aakombwa buli kuliyi'mi'li'ka likanisa lya Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Wala kaneabe mundu ywau'bi'li nambi'yambi' bai, li'nga aakane kwipuna no tu'mbu'ka muukumu kati Ibilisi. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Kai', apalikwa abe mundu ywakong'ondelwa kwa makowe manogau, ata ba panja ya likanisa, li'nga aakane laumilwa no kola mukitapa sa Ibilisi.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ayangatiyi mu Likanisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Nyinyonyo, ayangatiyi ba likanisa bapalikwa babe bandu bo isimika. Bapalikwali yelenganiya makowe pabalongela, wala lobya wi'mbi' ata pala mbanje kwa ndi'la ya oni. <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>Bapalikwa kwikamuliya imani ya kweli yatuumukuli Nnu'ngu' kwa mabinio manogau. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Ipalikwa kwapekeseni wi'ti', mana ibonekine ntu'pu' likosa bendawesa panga lyengo lya uyangatiyi wa likanisa. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Akinayumbo babe bapalikwa babe na isima, kanebabe abai, bapange makowe kwo li'ngi'lya, na bau'bi'li'ke kwa makowe goti. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Ayangatiyi ba likanisa bapalikwali tola matala, na bapalikwa kwayi'mi'li'ka wiso bana babe na bandu ba panyumba yabe.<verse eid="1TI 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Ayangatiyi babapanga lyengo wiso bendaisimika, kwa nyo babaa na makakala ga kwiala abali ya imani yitu mu Kilisitu Yesu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iyo ngu'lu' yaiumukulilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Pamope no panga gapi'tali masu'ba gambone nendaisa, nikuandikya malagyo ga nambi'yambi' li'nga <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>mana nisi'yite isa, upate tanga nnyendo waupalikwa munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' kwa bandu babau'bi'lile, nga likanisa lya Nnu'ngu' ywabile mwu'mi, na lyo nga lipi'pi'li' na nsingi wa kakape. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Eloo! Iyo yaiumukulilwe ya imani yitu ngu'lu',</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ywembe aumukulilwe kwa uyi'me wa mundu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">aakong'ondelilwe na Loo Mpeleteu panga mwene aki,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">aabonekanilwe na malaika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">aalilwe pakatikati ya bandu ba mataipwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Aau'bi'lilwe mudunia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">aau'bu'yilwe kunani kwa utukupu.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Balimu ba ubu'su'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Bai, Loo Mpeleteu alongela mpu'la panga mumasu'ba ga kuundi'la, bandu bi'ngi' baaileka imani ya kakape no bi'ngi'ya maloo go ku'pi'ya na mayi'gano ga masetani. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Mayi'gano kati go gabambiyilwa na bandu abu'su' na anapiki, bene mabinio gagaalabike kati gatiniyilwe na kyu'ma sene mwoto. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Bembe baakanikiya bandu kobeka no lya yakulya ya sampuli nsi'si', pamope no panga Nnu'ngu' aaumbike yakulya yi'lu' li'nga bandu babamwu'bi'lile no tanga ukweli bapoki na kunsukulu. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Kila saumbike Nnu'ngu' kinogau wala sakikanilwa ntu'pu', mana sapokelelwa kwa kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Kwa mwanjaa, kwa ndi'la ya liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' na kwo sali, kilyo sendapeleteka nnu'ngi' yake.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ntumisi nnogau wa Kilisitu Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Mana waku'mbu'kiye alongo mayi'gi'yo go, waapanga wa ntumisi nnogau wa Kilisitu Yesu. Kai', waapanga ulelilwe wiso mumayi'gi'yo ga imani na kugakota goyi'ganilwe. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Lakini wikane munomuno u'mo ya kidunia ya kwai'mbu' yangali maana, ila ukasane bi'ngi'ya gapala Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Kwa mwanjaa kwiyobeleka yi'ga ipate makakala kwendapwaika pasene, lakini kwiyobeleka bi'ngi'ya gapala Nnu'ngu' kubi na pwaila mumakowe goti ga ukoto wa nambi'yambi' na ga nsimu wawaaisa, kati mwalagi Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Alyo likowe lyo aminika, kai' lipalikwa liyi'ki'ti'lwe mpamo. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Natwenga kwa kitumbu sa li', twendakasana kwa mwanjaa tubi'i liu'bi'lyo litu kwa Nnu'ngu' ywabile mwu'mi, nga nkosopoli wa bandu boti, munomuno kwa balu' babau'bi'lile.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Ago nga mayi'gi'yo gaupalikwa kugalagya na kugayi'gana. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Mundu ywoywoti kaneausalawe unsembe wako, ila ube wa mundu wo yigilwa na babau'bi'lya kwa nnongelo wako na nnyendo wako, upendo na imani, na upeleteu. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Paunili'nda mpaka isa kwangu', witoleye kwasomya bandu Maandiko Mapeleteu ku'no kawakangamaya myoyo na kwayi'gana. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Uku'mbu'ki tumya upo ya kiloo yopeyilwe kwa malobe ga alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', palu' pawabi'kilwe maboko ga api'ndo ba kanisa. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ukasane kugapanga go kwa mwoyo wako woti, li'nga bandu boti bakubone mwoyendelya ku'la. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Wili'ndi'le wenga wamwene na mayi'gano gako. Mana upangite nnyo, waalu'a kwikosopolya wamwene na balu' babakupi'kania.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Mwaipalikwa kwapangya aumini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Kaneunkwi'li'ke nnalu'me nng'oi kwa kunkalipya, ila upalikwa unnyangatiye mbolembole kati tati' bako. Wapangi ansembe kati alongobo, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>na alwawa agoi wapangi kati akinamau' bako, na ai'nja kati alu'mbu'go, upange nyo kwa mwoyo mpeleteu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Waisimu alwawa awi'li'kwa na asengo babe bangali mundu ywa kwayangatiya. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Lakini nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa mana abile na bana au asu'ku'lu', bapalikwa timisa mwapala Nnu'ngu' kwa kwayangatiya abelei babe. Kwo panga nnyo, baapanga baki'li'bu'ya manogau gabaapangilwe, na nyo ngamwapendi Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa ywa kakape nga yu'lu' ywalekilwe kisake. Agabi'i mau'bi'lyo gake goti kwa Nnu'ngu', na ayendelya sali no lu'ba gapala kilo na muntwekati. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Lakini nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa ywatama mumaisa go minyikiya kila sakibona, aywo ayomwike waa pamope no panga balo akapu'mwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Malagyo go wabakiye bandu li'nga baakane pitya bo bi'ka lukoolo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Lakini mundu ywakotoka kwayangatiya alongo ba panyumba yake, aywo aikani imani na nga mmaya kulikoni ywangali u'bi'lya.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Nnwawa nng'wi'li'kwa li'nga ayingi mukipi'nga sa awi'li'kwa babayangatiyilwa na likanisa apalikwa aikiye myaka sitini no yendelya bu'ka belekwa, na abe nnwawa ywaatami na nnalu'me yumo mumaisa gake. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Abe akong'ondelilwe kwa iyendo yake inannoga kati muuleli wa bana, kwakemya ageni, mwoyo wa kwatumikiya aumini, kwayangatiya babateselwa, na kwitoleya panga ganannoga kwa ndi'la yoti. <verse eid="1TI 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Lakini kaneuyi'ki'ti kwayingiya alwawa bali' awi'li'kwa mukipi'nga sa awi'li'kwa, kwa mwanjaa maminyikiyo ga payi'ga go pala ku'nda gawesa kwayingya no lekekeya kuntumikiya Kilisitu. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Kwa nyo, bailetya ukumu yo ti'kwana lilagano lyabalagine nakwe Kilisitu pabaatumbwile. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Kai' pamope na go, baboyolwa na ukata no belabela mumayumba. Kai', akata bai lili, ila abai, bendapekeseni no longela makowe gangali pwaika. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Kwa nyo, nipala alwawa bali' awi'li'kwa baku'nde, bapape bana no tunja mayumba gabe, li'nga baakane kwapeya andumu lipala lya kutulongelya maakau. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Kwa mwanjaa, awi'li'kwa bi'ngi' bababile balo bali' bayomwike tindigana na kummi'ngi'ya Ibilisi. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Lakini nnwawa ywoywoti ywa likanisa mana abile na alongo awi'li'kwa, apalikwa kwayangatiya li'nga kulipu'ngu'ki'ya likanisa kigombo. Kwo panga nya, likanisa liwesa kwayangatiya awi'li'kwa bangali alongo.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Api'ndo ba likanisa babayimi'li'ka wiso mengo gabe bapalikwa isimilwa na bapangilwe manogau, munomuno babaitoleya ala no yi'gana. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Kwa mwanjaa Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya, “Kaneumwibe nkano ng'ombe pali'bata ngano li'nga ku'bata.” Kai', gabaya, “Mpangakasi apalikwa li'pi'lwa liposo lyake.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Kaneuyi'ki'ti sitakilwa kwa mpi'ndo wa likanisa mpaka upeyelwe ukong'ondeli wa bandu abi'li' au atatu. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Balu' api'ndo babayendelya panga sambi wakalipi ku'no bandu boti ba likanisa kabapi'kania, li'nga na bi'ngi' bayogope.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Nikulagya ga nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu', Kilisitu Yesu, na malaika bake Nnu'ngu' panga ugakamwe ga pangali kummawa wala kumpendeleya mundu ywoywoti mumakowe goti. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Kaneuyu'ngu'ye kummi'kya moko mundu kwa lyengo lya Bwana, kwa mwanjaa mana ummi'i mwene sambi, mwayangatiyana sambi yake. Wili'ndi'le ube wampeleteu.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Tumbulya nambi'yambi', kaneunywe masi' bai, ila unywe na divai pasene kwa kitumbu sa kitamwe sa ndumbo yako na itamwe yi'ngi' yaikokotya kukuauya.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Masambi ga bandu bi'ngi' gabonekana ata ukumu ibile balo timya, lakini masambi ga bandu bi'ngi' gatiiyanikwa na gaabonekana nnu'ngi'. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Nyinyonyo, iyendo inannoga iiyanikali, na ata yi'lu' inannoga yaiiyanikwe yaaumukulwa.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s">Mwabapalikwa abanda kwa angwana babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Abanda boti bapalikwa kwaisimu angwana babe munomuno, li'nga bandu baakane tukana lina lya Nnu'ngu' na gatuyi'gana. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Abanda bababile na angwana Akilisitu kanebaasalawe kwa mwanjaa bembe alongo babe. Ila baatumikiye wiso muno, kwa mwanjaa bayangatiya aumini ayabe na bendakwapenda.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Mayi'gano ga ubu'su' na utayili wa ukweli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Upalikwa yi'gana no aala makowe ga. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Manaitei mundu ywoywoti ayi'gana mayi'gano ga ubu'su' no kana mayi'gano magolou ga Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu na galu' gagabu'kana na gapala Nnu'ngu', <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>ywembe atwi'lya kwipuna wala akitangiteli kili'be, na kipi'li' sake taukana no kalipyana bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo gabule. Ago galeta bwigu, bulwe, matukano na maku'pi'ki'yano, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>na mayu'mano gangali yomoka ga bandu bene malango gagatindigine, ata balibali ukakape kabisa. Nga balu' babawasa panga dini nga ndi'la yo tayilika. <verse eid="1TI 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Kakape kwo bi'ngi'ya mwapala Nnu'ngu' kumpanga mundu apwailike muno mana yanni'ngana ili'be yabile nayo. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Kwa mwanjaa mudunia yi'no tuletikeli kili'be sosoti na tubu'kali na kili'be.<verse eid="1TI 6:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Ila mana tubile na kilyo na ngu'bo yo wala, ituli'ngane. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Lakini babapala utayili batu'mbu'ka mumapayilwo no kola mukitapa sa maminyikiyo maingi ga kilogeloge no sulu, gagaauta mpaka alabika no langanyika. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Kwa mwanjaa penda muno mbanje nga liina lya sampuli ya maakau maingi. Bandu bi'ngi', kwo minyikiya muno pata mbanje, bailei imani na kwilumiya bene kwo usunika muno.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Mayi'gano ga ikima kwa Timoteo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Lakini wenga wa mundu wa Nnu'ngu', makowe go ugatile. Ila ubi'ngi'ye aki na mwapala Nnu'ngu', imani, upendo, komeya no gegekeya. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Uku'mbwane ngondo inannoga ya imani. Uukamwe ukoto wangayomoka wembe ngaukemilwe kwa wo, pauupiyite ukong'ondeli wa kweli nnu'ngi' ya akong'ondeli baingi. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu' ywaipanga yumbe yoti ibe ngoti, na nnu'ngi' ya Kilisitu Yesu ywaapiyite ukong'ondeli wa kweli nnu'ngi' ya Pontio Pilato, nikulagya mayi'gi'yo gano. <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Wikamwe amuli yi' pangali likosa au lukoolo kwa bandu, mpaka paaisa Bwana witu Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Isa kwake kwapangilwa na Nnu'ngu' kwa nsimu waubi'i mwene. Ywembe nga Nnu'ngu' mwene balaka na ngatawala kisake, nga nkulungwa ywa akulungwa, na Bwana wa mabwana. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Nnu'ngu' kisake bai nga ywangali kwembana na kiwo, na atama pabweya pangali egelya mundu. Kai', ntu'pu' mundu ywamweni, wala ywawesa kummona. Ywembe nga mwene isima na uweso wangayomoka. Amina.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Wabakiye matayili ba padunia yi'no panga bakotoke kwilumba wala u'bi'lya utayili wabe waupi'ta bai. Ila bapalikwa kumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu', ywatupeya ili'be yoti pangali li'ngi'lya li'nga twitumi kwo napusika. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Kai', walagi panga bapange manogau, na utayili wabe ube wo panga manogau, babe anogamwoyo no yi'ki'tya tumya mali yabe kiselele na ayabe. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Kwa ndi'la yi', baibi'kya mabi'ko gagaapanga kati nsingi waukangamile kwa masu'ba gagaaisa. Apo, ngapabaalu'a pokya ukoto wa kakape.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Timoteo, ukamulikiye gaupeyilwe. Kanewiyingiye mumayi'gi'yo ga mudunia au mataukano gangali pwaika gagabayilwa nga ilimu, <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>kwa kugayi'ki'tya mayi'gano go ga ubu'su', bandu bi'ngi' bayomwike kwileka imani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 6:21">Mwaboti ninnu'bya ngu'ngu' ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
